# Generated art — App Store screenshots and widget/postcard renders.
# Regenerate with: xcrun simctl launch <udid> com.lorep.uk.Ephoemerous -shot exportart
# The captures and rendered panels stay out of the repo (large binaries), but
# the generators that BUILD the panels are source and are kept — see
# AppStoreShots/README.md.
AppStoreShots/*
!AppStoreShots/*.py
!AppStoreShots/*.sh
!AppStoreShots/*.md
WidgetArt/
